@startuml

actor User
boundary "React PWA Client" as Client
control "Web Bluetooth API" as WebAPI
entity "ESP32 Hardware Module" as ESP
entity "Wi-Fi Network" as WiFi
control "Node.js Server" as Server

== Device Discovery and Connection ==
User -> Client : Press "Add Device" button
Client -> WebAPI : Start BLE device scan
WebAPI --> Client : Return list of available BLE devices
User -> Client : Select Clear Zone device
Client -> WebAPI : Send connection request to device
WebAPI -> ESP : Send connection request to device
ESP --> WebAPI : Send connection status message
WebAPI --> Client : Send connection status message
Client ->> User : Display device name and connection status

== Wi-Fi Network Scan ==
Client -> WebAPI : Send Wi-Fi network scan request
WebAPI -> ESP : Send Wi-Fi network scan request
ESP -> WiFi : Send Wi-Fi network scan request
WiFi --> ESP : Return list of available networks
ESP --> WebAPI : Send list of available networks
WebAPI --> Client : Send list of available networks
Client ->> User : Display list of available networks

== Wi-Fi Network Connection ==
User -> Client : Select network and enter password
Client -> WebAPI : Send SSID and password
WebAPI -> ESP : Send SSID and password
ESP -> WiFi : Send connection request
WiFi --> ESP : Send connection status message
ESP -> Server : Send device registration request
Server --> ESP : Send JWT and HiveMQ credentials
ESP --> WebAPI : Send registration status message
WebAPI --> Client : Send registration status message
Client -> Server : Send request to link device to user account
Server --> Client : Send registration status message
Client ->> User : Display registration status message
@enduml